// Reduced from `solid-js@2.0.0-rc.3` `types/`. `action`, `createRoot`, `flush`,
// `onSettled` and `untrack` are re-exported from `@solidjs/signals` exactly as
// `types/index.d.ts:1` re-exports them, and `Element` from `./types.js` as
// `types/index.d.ts:7` does (that file is copied whole). `createOptimistic`,
// `createOptimisticStore` and the three types they use are copied byte for byte
// from `types/client/hydration.d.ts`. `createMemo`, `createSignal` and
// `createStore` are consts there whose call signatures repeat the signals
// overloads with hydration options, and `createEffect` is `typeof coreEffect`;
// the overloads these cases call return the same `SourceAccessor<T>`,
// `Signal<T>` and `[Store<T>, StoreSetter<T>]`, so the signals functions are
// re-exported directly here.
